{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18492","headline":"赋得秋河曙耿耿送郭秀才应举 · 欧阳詹","name":"赋得秋河曙耿耿送郭秀才应举","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"月没天欲明，秋河尚凝白。\n皑皑积光素，耿耿横虚碧。\n南斗接，北辰连，空蒙鸿洞浮高天。\n荡荡漫漫皆晶然，实类平芜流大川。\n星爲潭底珠，云是波中烟。\n鸡唱漏尽东方作，曲渚苍苍晓霜落。\n鴈叫疑从清浅惊，凫声似在沿洄泊。\n幷州细侯直下孙，才应秋赋怀金门。\n念排云汉将飞翻，仰之踊跃当华轩。\n夜来陪饯欧阳子，偶坐通宵见深旨。\n心知慷慨日昭然，前程心在青云里。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"欧阳詹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18492.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18492","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}